// Title: Arbitrary Binary Execution Using GUP Utility
// Rule ID: d65aee4d-2292-4cea-b832-83accd6cfa43
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_gup_arbitrary_binary_execution.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
